            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "New York Office REIT Sell-Off Overdone After NYC Mayoral Primary, Analyst Says",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The sharp selloff in New York office REITs in response to leftist Zohran Mamdani\u2019s upset victory in New York City\u2019s Democratic mayoral primary looks like an overreaction, according to one real estate analyst.  Piper Sandler analyst Alexander Goldfarb on Wednesday reiterated an Overweight rating on  SL Green Realty  one of the two leading New York office real estate investment trusts, along with  Vornado Realty Trust  He says it\u2019s too soon to call the November election.  Mamdani has proposed freezing rents on a large group of city apartments but he hasn\u2019t offered any ideas on office rents.",
